# Cache policy is DEFAULT-SAFE, then explicitly widened.
#
# /* sets a revalidate-always default so any file added to docs/ later is correct
# without anyone remembering a rule for it. Long caching is opt-in per path below.
# A forgotten rule then costs one revalidation, not days of stale content.
#
# NO `immutable` HERE, DELIBERATELY. These filenames are not content-hashed -
# index.html references plain site.css / site.js / favicon.svg. `immutable` tells
# browsers never to revalidate, not even on reload or hard refresh, so with stable
# names a CSS or JS fix could not reach anyone who had visited in the previous
# seven days. Measured live on aivoicemcp.pages.dev 2026-08-21 before this change.
# Only reintroduce `immutable` if the build starts emitting site.<hash>.css names.
#
# EVERY OVERRIDE DETACHES FIRST. Cloudflare Pages does not let a specific rule beat
# a general one - per its docs duplicate headers are "joined with a comma separator",
# so /site.css matching both blocks would emit two conflicting max-age values.
# `! Cache-Control` drops the inherited value before the new one is set.
#
# NOTE: GitHub Pages IGNORES this file. voice.aiwander.ai is served by GitHub Pages
# and returns max-age=600 regardless of anything here. These rules take effect only
# on the Cloudflare Pages deployment (aivoicemcp).

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self'; media-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), geolocation=(), microphone=()
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/site.css
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, must-revalidate

/site.js
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600, must-revalidate

/favicon.svg
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, must-revalidate

/*.png
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, must-revalidate
